doc:sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(4) 10  Meaning of direct OSP, indirect OSP and related terms" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) For subparagraph (3)(a)(ii), the provision of the specified goods or services must be: (a) where the OSP principal is the OSP chain principal—for the purpose of enabling the OSP chain principal to provide CDR consumers for the service data with the goods and services for the purposes of which a relevant consent to collect the service data, or the CDR data from which it was directly or indirectly derived, was given; and (b) otherwise—for the purpose of enabling the OSP principal to provide the goods and services specified in the CDR outsourcing arrangement for which it is the provider." ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(5) 10  Meaning of direct OSP, indirect OSP and related terms"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) For subparagraph (3)(b)(v), the things are the following: (a) provide that person with access to any service data that it holds; (b) in accordance with the CDR data deletion process, delete any service data that it holds and make the required records; (c) provide to that person any such required records;" ;
    skos:definition "(5) For subparagraph (3)(b)(v), the things are the following: (a) provide that person with access to any service data that it holds; (b) in accordance with the CDR data deletion process, delete any service data that it holds and make the required records; (c) provide to that person any such required records;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "def56812af3aa224a691617fffdf07335fd9bfc631296adbc9c57db06e7d30be" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-15 ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Provide access to service data, delete records, and provide required documents." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
