doc:sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(2) 10AA  Meaning of CDR representative and related terms" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A CDR representative arrangement may provide for the CDR representative: (a) to seek any consent for the use or disclosure of service data that the CDR representative principal could seek in the same circumstances; and (b) to make any use or disclosure of service data that would be:  (i) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data of the kind mentioned in paragraph 7.5(1)(j); or (ii) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data that relates to direct marketing of the kind mentioned in paragraph 7.5(3)(e)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(3) 10AA  Meaning of CDR representative and related terms"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A CDR representative arrangement must require the CDR representative: (a) not to enter into another CDR representative arrangement; and (b) not to engage a person as the provider in a CDR outsourcing arrangement in relation to service data except as provided in the CDR representative arrangement. Note: Because a CDR representative cannot collect CDR data except through its CDR representative principal, it cannot engage the provider to collect CDR data." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A CDR representative arrangement must require the CDR representative: (a) not to enter into another CDR representative arrangement; and (b) not to engage a person as the provider in a CDR outsourcing arrangement in relation to service data except as provided in the CDR representative arrangement. Note: Because a CDR representative cannot collect CDR data except through its CDR representative principal, it cannot engage the provider to collect CDR data."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2b5660a5f922ec5c83af034a6df598d39b907a45c16be367853689de89d8af60" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16 ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Cannot engage another provider for service data collection" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
