    values:originalText "(5) If an accredited person collects CDR data on behalf of another accredited person (the principal) as a direct or indirect OSP: (a) rules 7.4 and 7.9 apply only in relation to the principal; and (b) paragraph 7.10(1)(a) requires the principal to be identified. Meaning of required provision" ;
