doc:sch-4-sec-1-28-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(3) 17  CDR data de-identification process" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If this is possible, the accredited data recipient must: (a) determine the technique that is appropriate in the circumstances to de-identify the relevant data to the required extent; and   Preliminary  Part 1 General provisions relating to data holders and to accredited persons  Division 1.4 Section 1.17A Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (b) apply that technique to de-identify the relevant data to the required extent; and (c) delete, in accordance with the CDR data deletion process, any CDR data that must be deleted in order to ensure that no person is any longer identifiable, or reasonably identifiable, from the information referred to in paragraphs (2)(e) and (f); and (d) as soon as practicable, make a record to evidence the following: (i) its assessment that it is possible to de-identify the relevant data to the required extent; (ii) that the relevant data was de-identified to that extent; (iii) how the relevant data was de-identified, including records of the technique that was used; (iv) any persons to whom the de-identified data is disclosed." ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-28-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(4) 17  CDR data de-identification process"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-28-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If this is not possible, the accredited data recipient must delete the relevant data and any CDR data directly or indirectly derived from it in accordance with the CDR data deletion process. Note: For the CDR data deletion process, see rule 1.18." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If this is not possible, the accredited data recipient must delete the relevant data and any CDR data directly or indirectly derived from it in accordance with the CDR data deletion process. Note: For the CDR data deletion process, see rule 1.18."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9fe948cd8de6ca89a79876e7f6ecc6121c7b960bb6e5fb569c7251998b7fa491" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-28 ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delete CDR data and derived data upon impossibility of de-identification." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
