concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-28-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(5) 17  CDR data de-identification process"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-28-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) For this rule, the DDF is The De-Identification Decision-Making Framework published by the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner and Data61, as in force from time to time. Note: The De-Identification Decision-Making Framework could in 2023 be downloaded from Data61’s website (https://www.data61.csiro.au/)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) For this rule, the DDF is The De-Identification Decision-Making Framework published by the Office of the Australian Information Commissioner and Data61, as in force from time to time. Note: The De-Identification Decision-Making Framework could in 2023 be downloaded from Data61’s website (https://www.data61.csiro.au/)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c46479c74b9e604be5a82ae4198464d1a23458da5ebbede684cfb3d15383fbde" ;
