concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-34 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 22  SR data request by a CDR consumer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-34 ;
    values:originalText "Note: This rule relates to Division 3.2. (1) This rule applies where a CDR consumer proposes to make an SR data request. (2) The request must be made to the primary data holder, using the primary data holder’s direct request service." ;
    skos:definition "Note: This rule relates to Division 3.2. (1) This rule applies where a CDR consumer proposes to make an SR data request. (2) The request must be made to the primary data holder, using the primary data holder’s direct request service."@en ;
