concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(4) 23  SR data request by an accredited person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the CDR consumer authorises disclosure of requested data, the primary data holder must, using the service mentioned in subrule 1.20(2) and in accordance with the data standards, request the secondary data holder to disclose any SR data that the primary data holder needs in order to respond to the SR data request. Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the CDR consumer authorises disclosure of requested data, the primary data holder must, using the service mentioned in subrule 1.20(2) and in accordance with the data standards, request the secondary data holder to disclose any SR data that the primary data holder needs in order to respond to the SR data request. Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f68f42a14af9e0b9d45002f1b6b5f0d6b21877b62e84aed35f60f86881f3f597" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35 ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Primary data holder must request secondary data holder to disclose SR data." ;
