concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(5) 23  SR data request by an accredited person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the secondary data holder chooses to disclose the SR data requested to the primary data holder, it must do so in accordance with any relevant data standards.   Preliminary  Part 1 Application of rules in relation to SR data  Division 1.5 Section 1.24 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the secondary data holder chooses to disclose the SR data requested to the primary data holder, it must do so in accordance with any relevant data standards.   Preliminary  Part 1 Application of rules in relation to SR data  Division 1.5 Section 1.24 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a926fecf45573c0370d8cba13b5343816a068c3b4e6665932cb5f8e2cf5c8952" ;
