concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(11) 23  SR data request by an accredited person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-11 ;
    values:originalText "(11) Division 4.4 (authorisations to disclose CDR data) applies as if: (a) a reference to the data holder were a reference to the primary data holder; and (b) the following subrule were added after subrule 4.25(2) (withdrawal of authorisation by CDR consumer): “(3) For subrule (2), giving effect to withdrawal includes cancelling any current requests to the secondary data holder by the primary data holder under subrule 1.23(4).”." ;
    skos:definition "(11) Division 4.4 (authorisations to disclose CDR data) applies as if: (a) a reference to the data holder were a reference to the primary data holder; and (b) the following subrule were added after subrule 4.25(2) (withdrawal of authorisation by CDR consumer): “(3) For subrule (2), giving effect to withdrawal includes cancelling any current requests to the secondary data holder by the primary data holder under subrule 1.23(4).”."@en ;
