concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 3  Product data requests"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-2-6 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person may: Person makes a request for product data using a data holder’s product data request service. For any required product data, the data holder must (unless covered by an exception) disclose the data to the requester. For any voluntary product data, the data holder may, but is not required to, disclose the data to the requester. In either case, the data is disclosed through the data holder’s product data request service." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A person may: Person makes a request for product data using a data holder’s product data request service. For any required product data, the data holder must (unless covered by an exception) disclose the data to the requester. For any voluntary product data, the data holder may, but is not required to, disclose the data to the requester. In either case, the data is disclosed through the data holder’s product data request service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dfe7065ad9f6963801c0fa0b10e5ad6cc8305d8758c6cc6ffec5223f26df2f09" ;
    cof:pageNumber "51"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Requester may obtain product data from a data holder." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
