    cof:title "2(1) 5  Refusal to disclose required product data in response to product data" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product data in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data standards." ;
    cof:pageNumber "53"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2(2) 5  Refusal to disclose required product data in response to product data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with the data standards. Civil penalty: (a) for an individual―$50,000; and (b) for a body corporate―$250,000." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with the data standards. Civil penalty: (a) for an individual―$50,000; and (b) for a body corporate―$250,000."@en ;
