concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-3-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 4  Disclosing consumer data in response to a valid consumer data request"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3-7 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This rule applies if a data holder has received a request that it reasonably believes to be a valid consumer data request made under this Part, for disclosure of CDR data of which it is the data holder. (2) The data holder may disclose any requested voluntary consumer data to the CDR consumer who made the request. (3) The data holder must, subject to rule 3.5, disclose any requested required consumer data to the CDR consumer who made the request: (a) through its direct request service; and (b) in accordance with the data standards. Note 2: For a request that relates to a joint account, see rules 4A.10 and 4A.15 for additional circumstances in which data relating to the joint account might not be disclosed under these rules. Note 3: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Note 4: A fee cannot be charged for the disclosure of required consumer data: see section 56BU of the Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This rule applies if a data holder has received a request that it reasonably believes to be a valid consumer data request made under this Part, for disclosure of CDR data of which it is the data holder. (2) The data holder may disclose any requested voluntary consumer data to the CDR consumer who made the request. (3) The data holder must, subject to rule 3.5, disclose any requested required consumer data to the CDR consumer who made the request: (a) through its direct request service; and (b) in accordance with the data standards. Note 2: For a request that relates to a joint account, see rules 4A.10 and 4A.15 for additional circumstances in which data relating to the joint account might not be disclosed under these rules. Note 3: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Note 4: A fee cannot be charged for the disclosure of required consumer data: see section 56BU of the Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2ec9b6ab9f5b0f09cf1c8285825d8f02ff0a58715b5fd9ab7ea5876b3136cd16" ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer ;
