doc:sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(2A) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2A) The accredited person may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure consent in relation to CDR data, either: (a) at the same time the accredited person asks the CDR consumer to give a collection consent under subrule (2) in relation to CDR data; or (b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under subrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR has yet been collected. Note 1: Requests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled together (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A). Note 2: The CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation principle: see rule 1.8." ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(2B) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b ;
    values:originalText "(2B) If the accredited person is an affiliate and the CDR data will be collected by a sponsor at its request: (a) the request for a collection consent must specify that fact; and (b) a consent for the affiliate to collect the CDR data is taken to be consent for the sponsor to so collect it." ;
    skos:definition "(2B) If the accredited person is an affiliate and the CDR data will be collected by a sponsor at its request: (a) the request for a collection consent must specify that fact; and (b) a consent for the affiliate to collect the CDR data is taken to be consent for the sponsor to so collect it."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "256c9ffe65a6e121e75931fde831bd2bc165391af79e55d8884dce66bef010cb" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9 ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consent for sponsor to collect CDR data is implied if affiliate collects it at sponsor's request." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60" ;
    cml:asserts concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b-norm .
