doc:sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(3) Section 4" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The CDR representative may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure consent in relation to CDR data, either: (a) at the same time the CDR representative asks the CDR consumer to give a collection consent under subrule (2) in relation to the CDR data; or (b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under subrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR data has yet been collected. Note 1: Requests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled together (see subrules 4.3A(2) and (3). Note 2: The CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation principle: see rule 1.8." ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(4) Section 4"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In giving the consents, the CDR consumer gives the CDR representative principal a valid request to seek to collect that CDR data from the CDR participant. Note: If an accredited person seeks to collect CDR data under this Part without a valid request, it will contravene privacy safeguard 3 (a civil penalty provision under the Act): see section 56EF of the Act." ;
    skos:definition "(4) In giving the consents, the CDR consumer gives the CDR representative principal a valid request to seek to collect that CDR data from the CDR participant. Note: If an accredited person seeks to collect CDR data under this Part without a valid request, it will contravene privacy safeguard 3 (a civil penalty provision under the Act): see section 56EF of the Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "28f29a2c8bb124821140f8fe30e79c2e05ef3b7becd8e54660aff94682ddcaf2" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10 ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Request to collect CDR data must be valid" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62" ;
