doc:sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(4) Section 4" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) In giving the consents, the CDR consumer gives the CDR representative principal a valid request to seek to collect that CDR data from the CDR participant. Note: If an accredited person seeks to collect CDR data under this Part without a valid request, it will contravene privacy safeguard 3 (a civil penalty provision under the Act): see section 56EF of the Act." ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(5) Section 4"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The request ceases to be valid if the collection consent is withdrawn. Note: So long as the use consent is not also withdrawn, the CDR representative principal could continue to disclose CDR data it had already collected to the CDR representative, and the CDR representative could use it in order to provide the requested goods or services. However, the notification requirement of rule 4.20O would apply.   Consumer data requests made by accredited persons  Part 4 Consumer data requests made by accredited persons to CDR participants  Division 4.2 Section 4.3B Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(5) The request ceases to be valid if the collection consent is withdrawn. Note: So long as the use consent is not also withdrawn, the CDR representative principal could continue to disclose CDR data it had already collected to the CDR representative, and the CDR representative could use it in order to provide the requested goods or services. However, the notification requirement of rule 4.20O would apply.   Consumer data requests made by accredited persons  Part 4 Consumer data requests made by accredited persons to CDR participants  Division 4.2 Section 4.3B Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9c52ad0b0d2d648f8a64a85d469709897d46ae36a32d80763bab5641781f375d" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10 ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Request ceases to be valid if collection consent is withdrawn." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62" ;
