concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-11-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(2) 3B  Consumer data requests by accredited persons to CDR representatives"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-11-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Rule 4.7B applies in relation to a CDR representative that receives, or reasonably anticipates receiving, a consumer data request under rule 4.7A as applied by subrule (1), as if: (a) a reference to an accredited data recipient were a reference to the CDR representative; and (b) a reference to Division 4.3 were a reference to Division 4.3A. Subdivision 4.2.3—Consumer data requests by accredited persons to data holders" ;
    skos:definition "(2) Rule 4.7B applies in relation to a CDR representative that receives, or reasonably anticipates receiving, a consumer data request under rule 4.7A as applied by subrule (1), as if: (a) a reference to an accredited data recipient were a reference to the CDR representative; and (b) a reference to Division 4.3 were a reference to Division 4.3A. Subdivision 4.2.3—Consumer data requests by accredited persons to data holders"@en ;
