    values:originalText "(4) The accredited person must not, for an invitation to amend the period referred to in paragraph 4.11(1)(b): (a) give the invitation any earlier than a reasonable period before the current consent is expected to expire; or (b) give more than a reasonable number of such invitations within this period." ;
