doc:sch-4-sec-4-39-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(1) 18B  Notification if collection consent or AP disclosure consent expires" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This rule applies if: (a) an accredited person has made a consumer data request to an accredited data recipient on behalf of a CDR representative, based on a collection consent given under this Division relating to particular CDR data and that accredited data recipient; and (b) the accredited data recipient has an AP disclosure consent relating to that CDR data; and (c) the request has not been completely resolved." ;
    cof:pageNumber "77"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-39-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(2) 18B  Notification if collection consent or AP disclosure consent expires"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-39-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the collection consent expires in accordance with these rules, the accredited person must notify the accredited data recipient as soon as practicable of the expiry. Note 1: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Note 2: The AP disclosure consent that the accredited data recipient has expires when the notification is received—see subrule 4.14(4)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) If the collection consent expires in accordance with these rules, the accredited person must notify the accredited data recipient as soon as practicable of the expiry. Note 1: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Note 2: The AP disclosure consent that the accredited data recipient has expires when the notification is received—see subrule 4.14(4)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "76f1b525b0e0d0cb35fa7dfeca79b4d339d42e3c15c66de1ce25a33bff27c8bc" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-39 ;
    cof:pageNumber "77"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Notify accredited data recipient of expired collection consent." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
