concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-45 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 20C  Object"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-45 ;
    values:originalText "The object of this Division is to ensure that a consent is: (a) voluntary; and (b) express; and (c) informed; and (d) specific as to purpose; and (e) time limited; and (f) easily withdrawn. Subdivision 4.3A.2—Giving consents Note: Under rule 4.3A, if a CDR representative asks a CDR consumer for their consent to collect and use their CDR data, it must do so in accordance with this Division, and in particular, rules 4.20D, 4.20E and" ;
    skos:definition "The object of this Division is to ensure that a consent is: (a) voluntary; and (b) express; and (c) informed; and (d) specific as to purpose; and (e) time limited; and (f) easily withdrawn. Subdivision 4.3A.2—Giving consents Note: Under rule 4.3A, if a CDR representative asks a CDR consumer for their consent to collect and use their CDR data, it must do so in accordance with this Division, and in particular, rules 4.20D, 4.20E and"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "12fff1f34cc35a0ef53f72a384a42e8a39821554babbc445f628ac2657b5e3f5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consent requirements" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
