concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-46 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Section 4"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-46 ;
    values:originalText "20F. A failure to do so could result in the CDR representative principal being liable for one or more civil penalty provisions: see section 56EF of the Act and rule 1.16A." ;
    skos:definition "20F. A failure to do so could result in the CDR representative principal being liable for one or more civil penalty provisions: see section 56EF of the Act and rule 1.16A."@en ;
