doc:sch-4-sec-4-50-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4(3) 20F  Restrictions on seeking consent" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A CDR representative must not ask for a consent: (a) that is not in a category of consents; or (b) subject to subrule (4), for using the CDR data, including by aggregating the data, for the purpose of: (i) identifying; or (ii) compiling insights in relation to; or (iii) building a profile in relation to; any identifiable person who is not the CDR consumer who made the consumer data request." ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-50-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4(4) 20F  Restrictions on seeking consent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-50-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Paragraph (3)(b) does not apply in relation to a person whose identity is readily apparent from the CDR data, if the CDR representative is seeking consent to: (a) derive, from that CDR data, CDR data about that person’s interactions with the CDR consumer; and (b) use that derived CDR data in order to provide the requested goods or services." ;
    skos:definition "(4) Paragraph (3)(b) does not apply in relation to a person whose identity is readily apparent from the CDR data, if the CDR representative is seeking consent to: (a) derive, from that CDR data, CDR data about that person’s interactions with the CDR consumer; and (b) use that derived CDR data in order to provide the requested goods or services."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6042274885c7a428d04e34f19d851bdc29be214b2966dae00c68b1aeb60798fb" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-50 ;
    cof:pageNumber "83"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Seeking consent to derive and use CDR data for goods or services" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.83" ;
    cml:asserts concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-50-ss-4-norm .
