concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-53 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 20I  Process for amending consent"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-53 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to this rule, if a CDR representative allows CDR consumers to amend consents, it must allow them to do so in the same manner that it asks for CDR consumers to give consents. (3) In the case of an amendment to a consent, in addition to the information referred to in subrule 4.20E(3), the CDR representative must give the CDR consumer: (a) a statement that indicates the consequences of amending a consent; and (b) a statement that the CDR representative will be able to continue to use any CDR data that has already been disclosed to it to the extent allowed by the amended consent.   Consumer data requests made by accredited persons  Part 4 Giving and amending consents—CDR representatives  Division 4.3A Section 4.20J Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Subdivision 4.3A.4—Withdrawing consents" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to this rule, if a CDR representative allows CDR consumers to amend consents, it must allow them to do so in the same manner that it asks for CDR consumers to give consents. (3) In the case of an amendment to a consent, in addition to the information referred to in subrule 4.20E(3), the CDR representative must give the CDR consumer: (a) a statement that indicates the consequences of amending a consent; and (b) a statement that the CDR representative will be able to continue to use any CDR data that has already been disclosed to it to the extent allowed by the amended consent.   Consumer data requests made by accredited persons  Part 4 Giving and amending consents—CDR representatives  Division 4.3A Section 4.20J Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Subdivision 4.3A.4—Withdrawing consents"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1a11404729b905dc77042bbc00a4d605aa549af5dbc564057aaa1147d92e03af" ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-53-ss-1 ;
