concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-59 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 20L  Additional information relating to de-identification of CDR data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-59 ;
    values:originalText "For paragraph 4.20E(3)(i), the additional information relating to de-identification is the following: (a) what the CDR data de-identification process is; (b) if it would disclose (by sale or otherwise) the de-identified data to one or more other persons; (i) that fact; and (ii) the classes of persons to which it would disclose that data; and (iii) why it would so disclose that data; (c) if the CDR representative would use the de-identified data for general research―that fact, together with a link to a description in the CDR representative principal’s CDR policy of: (i) the research to be conducted; and (ii) any additional benefit to be provided to the CDR consumer for consenting to the use; (e) that the CDR consumer would not be able to elect, in accordance with rule" ;
    skos:definition "For paragraph 4.20E(3)(i), the additional information relating to de-identification is the following: (a) what the CDR data de-identification process is; (b) if it would disclose (by sale or otherwise) the de-identified data to one or more other persons; (i) that fact; and (ii) the classes of persons to which it would disclose that data; and (iii) why it would so disclose that data; (c) if the CDR representative would use the de-identified data for general research―that fact, together with a link to a description in the CDR representative principal’s CDR policy of: (i) the research to be conducted; and (ii) any additional benefit to be provided to the CDR consumer for consenting to the use; (e) that the CDR consumer would not be able to elect, in accordance with rule"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd33acf5104e66cfe8ee1935b3c0778bfe918f91fb0adb9afe8869d8f0a22c4d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "87"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Provides additional information about de-identification of CDR data" ;
    dc:description "Additional information relating to de-identification of CDR data" ;
