concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-69 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 20T  Updating consumer dashboard"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-69 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A CDR representative must inform the CDR representative principal as soon as practicable after the information required to be contained on the CDR representative principal’s consumer dashboard changes. Note: The CDR representative principal may allow the CDR representative to provide the consumer dashboard on its behalf—see subrule 1.14(5). (2) The CDR representative principal must, as soon as practicable, make those changes. Note 1: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Note 2: The CDR representative principal could arrange for the CDR representative to update the consumer dashboard on the CDR representative principal’s behalf: see subrule" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A CDR representative must inform the CDR representative principal as soon as practicable after the information required to be contained on the CDR representative principal’s consumer dashboard changes. Note: The CDR representative principal may allow the CDR representative to provide the consumer dashboard on its behalf—see subrule 1.14(5). (2) The CDR representative principal must, as soon as practicable, make those changes. Note 1: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Note 2: The CDR representative principal could arrange for the CDR representative to update the consumer dashboard on the CDR representative principal’s behalf: see subrule"@en ;
