concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-74 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 22A  Inviting CDR consumer to amend a current authorisation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-74 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a data holder has received a notice under rule 4.18C or 4.20S, the data holder must, in accordance with this Division, invite the CDR consumer to amend the authorisation to disclose CDR data accordingly. Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). (2) An amendment of an authorisation to disclose CDR data other than in accordance with subrule (1) is of no effect." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a data holder has received a notice under rule 4.18C or 4.20S, the data holder must, in accordance with this Division, invite the CDR consumer to amend the authorisation to disclose CDR data accordingly. Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). (2) An amendment of an authorisation to disclose CDR data other than in accordance with subrule (1) is of no effect."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "469d1973156ee643f1b3f462d061f3aa0d386ed23fda38b6b196a25f3e0ac534" ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-74-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-74-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.92" .
doc:sch-4-sec-4-74 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "4 22A  Inviting CDR consumer to amend a current authorisation" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a data holder has received a notice under rule 4.18C or 4.20S, the data holder must, in accordance with this Division, invite the CDR consumer to amend the authorisation to disclose CDR data accordingly. Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). (2) An amendment of an authorisation to disclose CDR data other than in accordance with subrule (1) is of no effect." ;
    cof:pageNumber "92"^^xsd:integer .

