    values:originalText "(6) The service must not do any of the following in relation to the processes that it provides for changing or proposing to change the disclosure option that applies to the joint account, or responding to such a proposal (the processes):   Joint accounts  Part 4A Disclosure options  Division 4A.2 Section 4A.7 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (a) add any requirements to the processes beyond those specified in the data standards and these rules; (b) offer additional or alternative services as part of the processes; (c) include or refer to other documents, or provide any other information, so as to reduce comprehensibility; (d) offer any pre-selected options." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The service must not do any of the following in relation to the processes that it provides for changing or proposing to change the disclosure option that applies to the joint account, or responding to such a proposal (the processes):   Joint accounts  Part 4A Disclosure options  Division 4A.2 Section 4A.7 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (a) add any requirements to the processes beyond those specified in the data standards and these rules; (b) offer additional or alternative services as part of the processes; (c) include or refer to other documents, or provide any other information, so as to reduce comprehensibility; (d) offer any pre-selected options."@en ;
