concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4A 14  Notification requirements for consumer data requests on joint accounts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4a-17 ;
    values:originalText "(1) For this rule, an approval notification is a notice given by the data holder: (a) to a relevant account holder, to inform them that the requester has given, amended or withdrawn an authorisation, or that the authorisation has expired; or (b) to the requester, to inform them that:" ;
