    values:originalText "(3) The data holder must, in accordance with any relevant data standards: (a) provide for alternative notification schedules (including reducing the frequency of notifications or not receiving notifications); and (b) give each joint account holder a means of selecting such an alternative, and of changing a selection. Note: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
