concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 3  CDR Accreditor may request further information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5-8 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CDR Accreditor may request that the accreditation applicant provide further information to support the application. (2) Without limiting subrule (1), the CDR Accreditor may request the further information: (a) in writing; or (b) in an interview with the CDR Accreditor; or (c) by phone, email, videoconferencing or any other form of electronic communication. Note: If the accreditation applicant does not provide the further information as requested under this rule, the CDR Accreditor might not be in a position to be satisfied, under section 56CA of the Act, that the applicant meets the criteria for accreditation." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CDR Accreditor may request that the accreditation applicant provide further information to support the application. (2) Without limiting subrule (1), the CDR Accreditor may request the further information: (a) in writing; or (b) in an interview with the CDR Accreditor; or (c) by phone, email, videoconferencing or any other form of electronic communication. Note: If the accreditation applicant does not provide the further information as requested under this rule, the CDR Accreditor might not be in a position to be satisfied, under section 56CA of the Act, that the applicant meets the criteria for accreditation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3f757d53496950bc46e324c46d9870aeba19408dd830e61b4c17cab6ceec9c6a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "107"^^xsd:integer ;
