doc:sch-4-sec-5-16-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "5(1A) 10  Other conditions on accreditation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) The CDR Accreditor may exercise a power under subrule (1): (a) at the time of accreditation under subsection 56CA(1) of the Act; or (b) at any time after accreditation." ;
