concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-16-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(2) 10  Other conditions on accreditation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5-16-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before exercising a power under this rule, the Accreditor must: (a) inform the accreditation applicant or accredited person, as appropriate, of the proposed imposition or variation; and (b) give the accreditation applicant or accredited person, as appropriate, a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation to the proposal. Note 1: Contravention of a condition could lead to suspension or revocation of accreditation: see items 6 and 7 of the table to rule 5.17. Note 2: Applications may be made to the Administrative Appeals Tribunal to review a decision under this rule: see paragraph 9.2(a)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Before exercising a power under this rule, the Accreditor must: (a) inform the accreditation applicant or accredited person, as appropriate, of the proposed imposition or variation; and (b) give the accreditation applicant or accredited person, as appropriate, a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation to the proposal. Note 1: Contravention of a condition could lead to suspension or revocation of accreditation: see items 6 and 7 of the table to rule 5.17. Note 2: Applications may be made to the Administrative Appeals Tribunal to review a decision under this rule: see paragraph 9.2(a)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cebb0b40920ac3174f5a075720b3e2d3149bbd4320a8ef807e4fe85257a9e495" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-16 ;
    cof:pageNumber "109"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inform and hear accreditation applicant before exercising power" ;
    dc:description "(a) inform, (b) give reasonable opportunity to be heard" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.109" ;
    cml:asserts concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-16-ss-2-norm .
