concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 11  Notification to accredited person relating to conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5-17 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CDR Accreditor must notify the accredited person, in writing, as soon as practicable after the imposition, variation or removal of a condition on an accreditation under rule 5.10. (2) The notice must include the following: (a) if a condition is imposed or varied: (i) the condition or the condition as varied; (ii) if applicable—the applicant’s rights to have the decision reviewed by the Administrative Appeals Tribunal; and (b) if a condition is removed—that fact. Subdivision 5.2.3—Obligations of accredited person" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The CDR Accreditor must notify the accredited person, in writing, as soon as practicable after the imposition, variation or removal of a condition on an accreditation under rule 5.10. (2) The notice must include the following: (a) if a condition is imposed or varied: (i) the condition or the condition as varied; (ii) if applicable—the applicant’s rights to have the decision reviewed by the Administrative Appeals Tribunal; and (b) if a condition is removed—that fact. Subdivision 5.2.3—Obligations of accredited person"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1656d2bb586843ee1f7e7a3b7d5587668e7fec951d81bfb814475273fcdc4445" ;
    cof:pageNumber "110"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-17-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-17-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
