concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 13  Accredited person must comply with conditions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5-19 ;
    values:originalText "An accredited person must comply with the conditions of their accreditation. Note 1: This rule applies to the default conditions set out in Schedule 1 and any conditions imposed or varied under rule 5.10. Note 2: This rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
    skos:definition "An accredited person must comply with the conditions of their accreditation. Note 1: This rule applies to the default conditions set out in Schedule 1 and any conditions imposed or varied under rule 5.10. Note 2: This rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."@en ;
