concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-26-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(2) 20  General process for suspension of accreditation or extension of suspension"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5-26-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Before suspending an accreditation under rule 5.17, or extending a suspension, the CDR Accreditor must: (a) inform the accredited person of: (i) the proposed suspension or extension (including the proposed duration); and (ii) in the case of a suspension—when it is proposed to take effect; and (b) give the accredited person a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation to the proposed suspension or extension." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Before suspending an accreditation under rule 5.17, or extending a suspension, the CDR Accreditor must: (a) inform the accredited person of: (i) the proposed suspension or extension (including the proposed duration); and (ii) in the case of a suspension—when it is proposed to take effect; and (b) give the accredited person a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation to the proposed suspension or extension."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "09e147194a08f0943000c8179d4da191ae1f0a79397cc8dd8c65c190807844b0" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-26 ;
    cof:pageNumber "115"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inform accredited person of proposed suspension or extension and give reasonable opportunity to be heard." ;
    dc:description "Information about proposed suspension or extension" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
