concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-39-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5(3) Section 5"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-5-39-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before, or as soon as practicable after, taking steps under subrule (1), the Accreditation Registrar must: (a) inform the data holder of the steps to be taken, or that have been taken; and (b) give the data holder a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation to the matter." ;
