doc:sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(2) 2  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For paragraph 56ED(3)(b) of the Act, the CDR entity’s CDR policy must be in the form of a document that is distinct from any of the CDR entity’s privacy policies. Additional information for CDR policy" ;
    cof:pageNumber "125"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(3) 2  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(4) of the Act, the data holder’s CDR policy must indicate: (a) whether it accepts requests for: (i) voluntary product data; or (ii) voluntary consumer data; and (b) if so: (i) whether it charges fees for disclosure of such data; and (ii) if it does―how information about those fees can be obtained." ;
    skos:definition "(3) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(4) of the Act, the data holder’s CDR policy must indicate: (a) whether it accepts requests for: (i) voluntary product data; or (ii) voluntary consumer data; and (b) if so: (i) whether it charges fees for disclosure of such data; and (ii) if it does―how information about those fees can be obtained."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2358cd8eb8ced7d80048ab9d338d812dbc5651d7d2a4d00b54a5f47a4389ba25" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "125"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Data holder must indicate acceptance of requests for voluntary product data and consumer data, including fees." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.125" ;
