doc:sch-4-sec-7-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7 3  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 2—anonymity and pseudonymity" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For subsection 56EE(3) of the Act, subsection 56EE(1) of the Act does not apply if: (a) the accredited person who is or may become an accredited data recipient of CDR data is required or authorised by law or by a court/tribunal order to deal with an identified CDR consumer in relation to particular CDR data; or (b) in relation to particular CDR data, it is impracticable for the accredited data recipient to deal with a CDR consumer that has not been identified." ;
    cof:pageNumber "127"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 3A  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 4—destruction of unsolicited data—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-5 ;
    values:originalText "CDR representative (1) A CDR representative principal breaches this subrule if its CDR representative fails to comply with section 56EG of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if; (a) it were an accredited person; and (b) it had collected the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). (2) For subrule (1), it is irrelevant whether the action of the CDR representative in relation to the service data is in accordance with the CDR representative arrangement." ;
    skos:definition "CDR representative (1) A CDR representative principal breaches this subrule if its CDR representative fails to comply with section 56EG of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if; (a) it were an accredited person; and (b) it had collected the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). (2) For subrule (1), it is irrelevant whether the action of the CDR representative in relation to the service data is in accordance with the CDR representative arrangement."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1272c36667a3a4ad4a75767cf79b185d5f7154c394f04b5e31021c7b3f05083e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "128"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-5-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-5-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
