doc:sch-4-sec-7-6-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(2) 3B  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 4—destruction of unsolicited data—" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For subrule (1), it is irrelevant whether the action of the direct or indirect OSP in relation to the service data is in accordance with the CDR outsourcing arrangement.   Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7 Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2 Section 7.4 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Subdivision 7.2.2—Rules relating to collecting CDR data" ;
