concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 7  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 6—use or disclosure of CDR by"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-11 ;
    values:originalText "accredited data recipients Note: Paragraph 56EI(1)(b) of the Act provides that an accredited data recipient of CDR data must not use or disclose it unless the use or disclosure is otherwise required, or authorised, under the consumer data rules. This rule provides an authorisation for that paragraph. Section 56EI of the Act applies only in relation to CDR data for which there are one or more CDR consumers: subsection 56EB(1) of the Act. For paragraph 56EI(1)(b) of the Act, the use or disclosure of CDR data for which there is a CDR consumer by an accredited data recipient of the CDR data is authorised under these rules if it is a permitted use or disclosure, other than one that relates to direct marketing." ;
    skos:definition "accredited data recipients Note: Paragraph 56EI(1)(b) of the Act provides that an accredited data recipient of CDR data must not use or disclose it unless the use or disclosure is otherwise required, or authorised, under the consumer data rules. This rule provides an authorisation for that paragraph. Section 56EI of the Act applies only in relation to CDR data for which there are one or more CDR consumers: subsection 56EB(1) of the Act. For paragraph 56EI(1)(b) of the Act, the use or disclosure of CDR data for which there is a CDR consumer by an accredited data recipient of the CDR data is authorised under these rules if it is a permitted use or disclosure, other than one that relates to direct marketing."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "331f25fbd9d505c22d80e80ead68c13a3ab334993f6d8e2a11af5612c08cc33f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "133"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Use or disclosure of CDR by accredited data recipients is permitted, subject to certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.133" ;
    cml:asserts concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-11-norm .
