doc:sch-4-sec-7-13 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7 8A  Rule relating to privacy safeguards 8 and 9—failure by CDR" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "representative to comply with safeguards Privacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure (1) A CDR representative principal breaches this subrule if its CDR representative fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "133"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Section 7"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-14 ;
    values:originalText "8B  Rule relating to privacy safeguards 8 and 9—failure by direct or indirect OSP to comply with safeguards Privacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure (1) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Privacy safeguard 9—government related identifiers (2) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EL of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
    skos:definition "8B  Rule relating to privacy safeguards 8 and 9—failure by direct or indirect OSP to comply with safeguards Privacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure (1) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Privacy safeguard 9—government related identifiers (2) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EL of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0e1043b46c8adf8c79fa407323196865e1b1f10756ea53962bcf5567a6c2d267" ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-14-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-14-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.134" .
doc:sch-4-sec-7-14 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7 Section 7" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "8B  Rule relating to privacy safeguards 8 and 9—failure by direct or indirect OSP to comply with safeguards Privacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure (1) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Privacy safeguard 9—government related identifiers (2) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EL of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-14-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(1) Section 7"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-14-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Privacy safeguard 9—government related identifiers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Privacy safeguard 9—government related identifiers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9c6a446e39ac69cfbd9acf046a4bde622a1fdb8ba2af93af4376b0a23d1d30b1" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-14 ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data is prohibited." ;
