doc:sch-4-sec-7-14-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(1) Section 7" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An accredited person breaches this subrule if a direct or indirect OSP of: (a) the accredited person; or (b) a CDR representative of the accredited person; fails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data. Note 1: See rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative arrangement. Note 2: This subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8). Privacy safeguard 9—government related identifiers" ;
    cof:pageNumber "134"^^xsd:integer .

