concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 10  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 11—quality of CDR data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-16 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If a CDR participant makes a disclosure of a kind referred to in paragraphs 56EN(3)(a) and (b) of the Act to an accredited person, the CDR participant must provide the CDR consumer on whose behalf the disclosure was made, by electronic means, with a written notice that:" ;
    skos:definition "(1) If a CDR participant makes a disclosure of a kind referred to in paragraphs 56EN(3)(a) and (b) of the Act to an accredited person, the CDR participant must provide the CDR consumer on whose behalf the disclosure was made, by electronic means, with a written notice that:"@en ;
