doc:sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(1) 11  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 12—security of CDR data" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For subsection 56EO(1) of the Act, the steps are set out in Schedule 2. Note: Broadly speaking, the steps are for an accredited data recipient of CDR data to: • define and implement security governance in relation to CDR data; and • define the boundaries of the CDR data environment; and • have and maintain an information security capability; and • implement a formal controls assessment program; and • manage and report security incidents." ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(2) 11  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 12—security of CDR data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is an OSP chain principal, a failure by a direct or indirect OSP to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by the accredited data recipient.   Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7 Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2 Section 7.12 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(2) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is an OSP chain principal, a failure by a direct or indirect OSP to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by the accredited data recipient.   Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7 Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2 Section 7.12 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0fc29ad785378f0ab07886805e9d353b80f33fcd5fd1e40b9d8c90426e629c8e" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-18 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to comply with Schedule 2 is attributed to the accredited data recipient." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.136" ;
