doc:sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7(2) 11  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 12—security of CDR data" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is an OSP chain principal, a failure by a direct or indirect OSP to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by the accredited data recipient.   Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7 Rules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2 Section 7.12 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020" ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7(3) 11  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 12—security of CDR data"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is a CDR representative principal, a failure by: (a) the CDR representative; or (b) any direct or indirect OSP of the CDR representative; to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by the CDR representative principal." ;
    skos:definition "(3) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is a CDR representative principal, a failure by: (a) the CDR representative; or (b) any direct or indirect OSP of the CDR representative; to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by the CDR representative principal."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c45e1f451339f299a60e1f4e310a26cefb4da925b3cacdf459023f1d10a7174f" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-18 ;
    cof:pageNumber "136"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Failure to comply with Schedule 2 is attributed to the CDR representative principal" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
