concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 7  Observers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-8-14 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Any of the following: (a) the Commission; (b) the Information Commissioner; (c) the Department of the Treasury; may elect to be an observer on a Data Standards Advisory Committee. (2) The Data Standards Chair may invite any other person to act as an observer on a Committee.   Rules relating to data standards  Part 8 Reviewing, developing and amending data standards  Division 8.3 Section 8.8 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Any of the following: (a) the Commission; (b) the Information Commissioner; (c) the Department of the Treasury; may elect to be an observer on a Data Standards Advisory Committee. (2) The Data Standards Chair may invite any other person to act as an observer on a Committee.   Rules relating to data standards  Part 8 Reviewing, developing and amending data standards  Division 8.3 Section 8.8 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"@en ;
