concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-88 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 20(3) or subrule 4.20U(3) (current consents);"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-88 ;
    values:originalText "(g) the processes for CDR participants to notify other CDR participants of withdrawal of consent or authorisations by CDR consumers; (h) the provision of administrative or ancillary services by CDR participants to facilitate the management and receipt of communications between CDR participants. (1A) The standards for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a)(ii) that relate to obtaining insight disclosure consents must include provisions that cover the following:" ;
    skos:definition "(g) the processes for CDR participants to notify other CDR participants of withdrawal of consent or authorisations by CDR consumers; (h) the provision of administrative or ancillary services by CDR participants to facilitate the management and receipt of communications between CDR participants. (1A) The standards for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a)(ii) that relate to obtaining insight disclosure consents must include provisions that cover the following:"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "37d0b71c37b8422c980b282b7c6e51a0f8d4129ac655aa9c24f418560ee54894" ;
    cof:pageNumber "145"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Processes for notifying other CDR participants of withdrawal of consent or authorisations by CDR consumers and provision of administrative services." ;
