doc:sch-4-sec-9-10-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9(1) 5  Requests from CDR consumers for copies of records" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A CDR consumer may request a data holder for copies of records relating to the information referred to in paragraphs 9.3(1)(a), (b), (c), (d), (f) and (fa) that relates to the CDR consumer. Requests to accredited data recipients" ;
    cof:pageNumber "157"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-9-10-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9(2) 5  Requests from CDR consumers for copies of records"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-9-10-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A CDR consumer may request an accredited data recipient for copies of records relating to the information referred to in: (a) paragraphs 9.3(2)(a), (b), (c), (d), (da), (e), (ea), (eb), (ec), (ed), (ee), (ef), (eg), (f) and (m); and (b) paragraphs 9.3(2A)(d), (e), (f), (g), (ga), (h), (ha), (hb), (hc), (i) and (o); that relates to the CDR consumer. Form for requests" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A CDR consumer may request an accredited data recipient for copies of records relating to the information referred to in: (a) paragraphs 9.3(2)(a), (b), (c), (d), (da), (e), (ea), (eb), (ec), (ed), (ee), (ef), (eg), (f) and (m); and (b) paragraphs 9.3(2A)(d), (e), (f), (g), (ga), (h), (ha), (hb), (hc), (i) and (o); that relates to the CDR consumer. Form for requests"@en ;
