concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-9-10-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9(5) 5  Requests from CDR consumers for copies of records"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-9-10-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A data holder must not charge a fee for making or responding to a request under subrule (1). Civil penalty: (a) for an individual―$50,000; and (b) for a body corporate―$250,000." ;
