doc:sch-4-sec-9-11-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9(1) 6  Audits by the Commission and the Information Commissioner" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commission may, at any time, audit the compliance of any CDR participant with any or all of the following: (a) Part IVD of the Act, including Division 5 of Part IVD to the extent that it relates to these rules; (b) these rules; (c) the data standards." ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-9-11-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9(2) 6  Audits by the Commission and the Information Commissioner"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-9-11-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Information Commissioner may, at any time, audit the compliance of any CDR participant with any or all of the following: (a) the privacy safeguards (Division 5 of Part IVD of the Act); (b) these rules to the extent that they relate to: (i) the privacy safeguards (see in particular Part 7 of these rules); or (ii) the privacy and confidentiality of CDR data." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Information Commissioner may, at any time, audit the compliance of any CDR participant with any or all of the following: (a) the privacy safeguards (Division 5 of Part IVD of the Act); (b) these rules to the extent that they relate to: (i) the privacy safeguards (see in particular Part 7 of these rules); or (ii) the privacy and confidentiality of CDR data."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8cc1f3691196a63cee2e018c844e657e92aff4b3f00e9906faf7206797eeeeee" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-9-11 ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Information Commissioner may audit compliance with privacy safeguards." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
