doc:sch-2-sec-1-11-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(2) 4  Step 2—Define the boundaries of the CDR data environment" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The accredited data recipient must review the boundaries of its CDR data environment for completeness and accuracy: (a) as soon as practicable when it becomes aware of material changes to the extent and nature of threats to its CDR data environment; or (b) where no such material changes occur—at least annually." ;
