doc:sch-3-sec-1-12-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(1) 5  Meaning of trial product" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) For these rules, in relation to the banking sector and NBL sector, a covered product is a trial product if the product is offered: (a) with the description “pilot” or “trial”; and (b) with a statement that it will operate as a pilot or trial for a period that ends no more than 6 months after the initial offering (the trial period); and (c) on the basis that the number of customers supplied with the product for the purposes of the trial will be no more than 1,000; and  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3 Preliminary  Part 1 Clause 1.5 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (d) with a statement that the product may be terminated before the end of the trial period and that, if it is, the CDR data in relation to the product may not be available for data sharing under these rules." ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-1-12-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1(2) 5  Meaning of trial product"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-1-12-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A covered product will cease to be a trial product from the first time any of the following occurs: (a) the product is supplied or offered after the end of the trial period; (b) the product begins to be supplied to more than 1,000 customers.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A covered product will cease to be a trial product from the first time any of the following occurs: (a) the product is supplied or offered after the end of the trial period; (b) the product begins to be supplied to more than 1,000 customers.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ad96baecb32cccce5242ddea11ca8fc2154d0016fb30a2cbc77e84b499b92670" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-1-12 ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Product ceases to be trial product under specified conditions" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
