concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-2-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 1  Additional criteria for eligibility—banking and NBL sectors"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2-4 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of subrules 1.10B(1) and (2), the additional criterion for a CDR consumer to be eligible in relation to a particular data holder in the banking sector or the NBL sector at a particular time, is that the account mentioned in paragraph 1.10B(1)(b) or (2)(b) is set up in such a way that, at that time, it can be accessed online. Note: Rule 1.10B provides, among other things, that a person is eligible in relation to a data holder if the person is: (a) an account holder or secondary user for an account with the data holder; or (b) a partner in a partnership that has an account with the data holder (whether or not the person is an account holder or secondary user)." ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of subrules 1.10B(1) and (2), the additional criterion for a CDR consumer to be eligible in relation to a particular data holder in the banking sector or the NBL sector at a particular time, is that the account mentioned in paragraph 1.10B(1)(b) or (2)(b) is set up in such a way that, at that time, it can be accessed online. Note: Rule 1.10B provides, among other things, that a person is eligible in relation to a data holder if the person is: (a) an account holder or secondary user for an account with the data holder; or (b) a partner in a partnership that has an account with the data holder (whether or not the person is an account holder or secondary user)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2fddc099d2311b7fd0ba9b8f6e5361eefd8f48c416caae23691951c735cba75f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "184"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Account must be accessible online for a CDR consumer to be eligible in relation to a data holder." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.184" ;
    cml:asserts concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-2-4-norm .
