concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-5-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 2  Meeting external dispute resolution requirements―banking sector and NBL"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-5-4 ;
    values:originalText "sector For the banking sector and NBL sector, an accredited person or data holder meets the external dispute resolution requirements if it is a member of the recognised external dispute resolution scheme operated by the Australian Financial Complaints Authority Limited for the relevant sector.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors" ;
    skos:definition "sector For the banking sector and NBL sector, an accredited person or data holder meets the external dispute resolution requirements if it is a member of the recognised external dispute resolution scheme operated by the Australian Financial Complaints Authority Limited for the relevant sector.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"@en ;
