doc:sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6(5) 2  Meaning of initial provider and large provider" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) However, a relevant non-bank lender to whom subclause (4) applies is taken, for the purposes of that subclause, to cease to meet the large provider qualification on and after a later day if the lender: (a) ceases to be an accredited person on that later day; and (b) has not met the large provider qualification in subclause (3) at any time before that later day. Calculating averaged value of resident loans and resident finance leases" ;
    cof:pageNumber "190"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6(6) 2  Meaning of initial provider and large provider"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purpose of calculating the averaged value of resident loans and resident finance leases reported by a relevant non-bank lender and each of its associated non-bank lenders over 12 calendar months, any month in relation to which no report was made by the lender, or any of its associated non-bank lenders, is to be disregarded. Note: A lender is not required to provide a monthly report to the Australian Prudential Regulation Authority under the applicable standards if its total assets are less than $400 million as at the last day of its financial year." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purpose of calculating the averaged value of resident loans and resident finance leases reported by a relevant non-bank lender and each of its associated non-bank lenders over 12 calendar months, any month in relation to which no report was made by the lender, or any of its associated non-bank lenders, is to be disregarded. Note: A lender is not required to provide a monthly report to the Australian Prudential Regulation Authority under the applicable standards if its total assets are less than $400 million as at the last day of its financial year."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "713494a53a7419a2dd32a6ae13646e97f98045b4d2f24ccd78c3c749fbe478b9" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14 ;
    cof:pageNumber "190"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disregard months with no report for averaging resident loans and finance leases." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.190" ;
    cml:asserts concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6-norm .
