concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 4  Application to initial providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-6-17 ;
    values:originalText "(1) These rules apply, as set out in the following table, in relation to a relevant non-bank lender that is an initial provider.  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3 Application of these rules to the banking and NBL sectors  Part 6 Clause 6.5 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Application to initial providers Column 1 Type of request Column 2 Application of rules A product data request under Part 2 of these rules On and after the tranche 1 date A consumer data request under Part 4 of these rules, other than a complex request On and after the tranche 2 date (2) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a relevant non-bank lender that is an initial provider." ;
    skos:definition "(1) These rules apply, as set out in the following table, in relation to a relevant non-bank lender that is an initial provider.  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3 Application of these rules to the banking and NBL sectors  Part 6 Clause 6.5 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 Application to initial providers Column 1 Type of request Column 2 Application of rules A product data request under Part 2 of these rules On and after the tranche 1 date A consumer data request under Part 4 of these rules, other than a complex request On and after the tranche 2 date (2) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a relevant non-bank lender that is an initial provider."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "17ec98c64bdbf36daa757b914218435eeca6da67674b763d0d2c82c4b0df9bad" ;
    cof:pageNumber "192"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-17-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-17-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
