doc:sch-3-sec-6-18-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6(3) 5  Application to large providers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is after 13 July 2025 date as set out in the following table. Application to large providers with LP date after 13 July 2025 Column 1 Type of request Column 2 Application of rules A product data request under Part 2 of these rules On and after the day 12 months after its LP date A consumer data request under Part 4 of these rules, other than a complex request On and after the day 15 months after its LP date" ;
    cof:pageNumber "193"^^xsd:integer .

