    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-6-24-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) These rules apply to the data holder in respect of that request, and all subsequent requests under Part 2 or Part 4 of these rules by consumers who are eligible in relation to that data holder. Note: This clause means that, among other things, a data holder who elects to receive and respond to such a request must comply with all aspects of these rules relevant to handling it (and all future requests by eligible consumers). For instance, the data holder would need to provide the consumer dashboard in accordance with subrule 1.15(1) upon receiving a request under Part 4, and would need to meet the internal and external dispute resolution requirements.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors" ;
    skos:definition "(3) These rules apply to the data holder in respect of that request, and all subsequent requests under Part 2 or Part 4 of these rules by consumers who are eligible in relation to that data holder. Note: This clause means that, among other things, a data holder who elects to receive and respond to such a request must comply with all aspects of these rules relevant to handling it (and all future requests by eligible consumers). For instance, the data holder would need to provide the consumer dashboard in accordance with subrule 1.15(1) upon receiving a request under Part 4, and would need to meet the internal and external dispute resolution requirements.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "70ebb1cb55660a6de57e9cd67ad74519575d8aacabe17713ab251508c6ee1c8c" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-24 ;
    cof:pageNumber "197"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Comply with all aspects of these rules relevant to handling a request and future requests by eligible consumers." ;
    dc:description "comply with all aspects of these rules" ;
