concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 3  Streamlined accreditation—banking sector"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-7-10 ;
    values:originalText "For paragraph 5.5(b) of these rules, for the banking sector, the criteria for streamlined accreditation are that the accreditation applicant:  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3 Other rules and modifications of these rules, for the banking sector and NBL sector  Part 7 Clause 7.4 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (a) is an ADI; but (b) is not a restricted ADI." ;
    skos:definition "For paragraph 5.5(b) of these rules, for the banking sector, the criteria for streamlined accreditation are that the accreditation applicant:  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3 Other rules and modifications of these rules, for the banking sector and NBL sector  Part 7 Clause 7.4 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (a) is an ADI; but (b) is not a restricted ADI."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a0390f368733ccac9cae615a8c9b3731566d7464bc0404ae6591857aac64c91f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "200"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Criteria for streamlined accreditation in the banking sector" ;
