    values:originalText "(2) An accredited person that: (a) is an ADI; but (b) is not a restricted ADI; need not comply with paragraph 5.12(2)(b) of these rules." ;
    cof:pageNumber "201"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 5  Grounds for revocation, suspension and surrender of accreditation—"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-7-12 ;
    values:originalText "banking sector For item 5 of the table in rule 5.17: (b) the relevant condition is that the accredited person was, at the time of the accreditation, an ADI; and (c) the accredited person ceases to satisfy the condition if its authority to carry on banking business is no longer in force.  Schedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors" ;
