concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(3) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, without limiting subclause (2): (a) these rules apply as though a reference in the request, authorisation or consent to the data holder and the CDR data in the NBL sector were a reference to the data holder and CDR data in the banking sector; and (b) the consent or authorisation does not expire merely because the data holder has ceased to operate in in the NBL sector. Data holder must respond to the request" ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, without limiting subclause (2): (a) these rules apply as though a reference in the request, authorisation or consent to the data holder and the CDR data in the NBL sector were a reference to the data holder and CDR data in the banking sector; and (b) the consent or authorisation does not expire merely because the data holder has ceased to operate in in the NBL sector. Data holder must respond to the request"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "75a346df88e15cfbe359468d4fb5b257bfb04326920afc058183451743921406" ;
