doc:sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "8(3) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, without limiting subclause (2): (a) these rules apply as though a reference in the request, authorisation or consent to the data holder and the CDR data in the NBL sector were a reference to the data holder and CDR data in the banking sector; and (b) the consent or authorisation does not expire merely because the data holder has ceased to operate in in the NBL sector. Data holder must respond to the request" ;
    cof:pageNumber "202"^^xsd:integer .

concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(4) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Despite anything else in this Schedule, the data holder must respond to the request in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as the case requires. Note: If the data holder has become a restricted ADI, it will be an excluded ADI, and this provision will override clause 1.1A. If it becomes an unrestricted ADI, this provision will override the allowance of time in clause 6.9. CDR consumer must be notified of change of sector" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Despite anything else in this Schedule, the data holder must respond to the request in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as the case requires. Note: If the data holder has become a restricted ADI, it will be an excluded ADI, and this provision will override clause 1.1A. If it becomes an unrestricted ADI, this provision will override the allowance of time in clause 6.9. CDR consumer must be notified of change of sector"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd9136d4bd6884744d834bbc3abfa9b32fadc63023b2677ad0bfe30870fd588f" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "202"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must respond to request in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as required." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
