    values:originalText "(5) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a written notification to each CDR consumer in respect of whom a request mentioned in subclause (1) is on foot that: (a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and (b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector; and (c) the data requested is now banking sector data; and  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3 Entities that move from NBL sector to banking sector  Part 8 Clause 8.1 Competition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020 (d) the CDR consumer may, under rule 4.13, 4.20J or 4.25, choose to withdraw an authorisation or consent given under Part 4 in respect of the request." ;
