concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(6) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a written notification to each accredited person who made a consumer data request mentioned in subclause (1) that: (a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and (b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector." ;
    skos:definition "(6) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a written notification to each accredited person who made a consumer data request mentioned in subclause (1) that: (a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and (b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8388e071d8763a36a4d27dcd7e922a74b7cf144e47f20472b6038658bf38de2a" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2 ;
