concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8(7) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Where an accredited person would be required to update the consumer dashboard of a relevant CDR consumer under rule 4.19 as a result of the sector change mentioned in subclause (1), the accredited person must instead update the consumer dashboard within a reasonable period after receiving the notification mentioned in subclause (6).  Schedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector" ;
    skos:definition "(7) Where an accredited person would be required to update the consumer dashboard of a relevant CDR consumer under rule 4.19 as a result of the sector change mentioned in subclause (1), the accredited person must instead update the consumer dashboard within a reasonable period after receiving the notification mentioned in subclause (6).  Schedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e63bce4f55f950653fad646de2f5d64c7d5ba11b1a9ea7c81b5f69f7851b9010" ;
    values:partOf concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2 ;
    cof:pageNumber "202"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Update consumer dashboard within a reasonable period after receiving notification." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
