concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-3-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 2  Meaning of required consumer data and voluntary consumer data—energy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3-11 ;
    values:originalText "sector (1) In this clause: relevant account, in relation to a CDR consumer, means an account for which the CDR consumer is an account holder or secondary user and is: (a) an account held by the CDR consumer in their name alone; or (b) a joint account; or (c) a partnership account.  Schedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector" ;
    skos:definition "sector (1) In this clause: relevant account, in relation to a CDR consumer, means an account for which the CDR consumer is an account holder or secondary user and is: (a) an account held by the CDR consumer in their name alone; or (b) a joint account; or (c) a partnership account.  Schedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "13cc028d0f18ae99abb7fe652ea74408c92e52d3329b9f40690651f0739b62fe" ;
    cof:pageNumber "211"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines relevant account for CDR consumer in energy sector" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
