concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-93 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 2  Product data request service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-4-93 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Despite rule 1.12, a data holder of energy sector data, other than the AER and the Victorian agency, is not required to provide a product data request service. (2) However, if such a data holder chooses to provide an online service that can be used to make product data requests, the service must comply with rule 1.12." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Despite rule 1.12, a data holder of energy sector data, other than the AER and the Victorian agency, is not required to provide a product data request service. (2) However, if such a data holder chooses to provide an online service that can be used to make product data requests, the service must comply with rule 1.12."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d57c1d2bc58e54868a77f1e38410962830ada551397b01e6cdbce0c6c773643b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "214"^^xsd:integer ;
