concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 1  Reporting requirements (rule 9.4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-7-24 ;
    values:originalText "Rule 9.4 applies to AER and the Victorian agency as if subrule 9.4(1) were replaced by the following, referring to either as “the Agency”: “(1) The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period that: (a) is in the form approved by the Commission for the purposes of this rule; and (b) sets out the number (if any) of product data requests received by the Agency during the reporting period; and (c) sets out: (i) the number of times the Agency refused to disclose CDR data; and (ii) the rule or data standard relied upon to refuse to disclose that data; and (iii) the number of times the Agency has relied on each of those rules or data standards as a ground of refusal.”.  Schedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector" ;
    skos:definition "Rule 9.4 applies to AER and the Victorian agency as if subrule 9.4(1) were replaced by the following, referring to either as “the Agency”: “(1) The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period that: (a) is in the form approved by the Commission for the purposes of this rule; and (b) sets out the number (if any) of product data requests received by the Agency during the reporting period; and (c) sets out: (i) the number of times the Agency refused to disclose CDR data; and (ii) the rule or data standard relied upon to refuse to disclose that data; and (iii) the number of times the Agency has relied on each of those rules or data standards as a ground of refusal.”.  Schedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "077f09e3a636784bd33e484e60f1b1421e97c4f55e35c781d4f86edebb5c767d" ;
    cof:pageNumber "219"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf> ;
