concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-9-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 1  Laws relevant to the management of CDR data—energy sector"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-9-15 ;
    values:originalText "For paragraph (f) of the definition of “law relevant to the management of CDR data” in rule 1.7 of these rules: (a) the National Electricity Law; and (b) the National Energy Retail Law; and (c) the Electricity Industry Act 2000 (Vic); are laws relevant to the management of CDR data in relation to the energy sector." ;
    skos:definition "For paragraph (f) of the definition of “law relevant to the management of CDR data” in rule 1.7 of these rules: (a) the National Electricity Law; and (b) the National Energy Retail Law; and (c) the Electricity Industry Act 2000 (Vic); are laws relevant to the management of CDR data in relation to the energy sector."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3332f4b69232ea013c2f9e8ce7d89af1bba3b3b15c13acd84d481d375543c1db" ;
    cof:pageNumber "224"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Laws relevant to CDR data management in the energy sector" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
